# This repo owns only what ties the project together. Everything else in here is
# its own repo, cloned beside the others, or a build directory. Ignoring by
# default means a new game needs no edit here, and a stray checkout can never be
# committed as a gitlink by accident.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
# the hashes of the copy Jake has signed off, per ~/.claude/voice/check-voice.
# Committed, because a signature that lives only on one machine says nothing
# to the next clone and nothing in a diff.
!/.copy-signed
!/README.md
!/RELEASING.md
!/LICENSE-MIT
!/LICENSE-APACHE
!/list-repos
!/check-all
!/check-listings
!/check-specs
!/check-tunnel
!/check-film
!/same-picture

# Spec 0096's spike: does a ray query work at all on this stack. Its own
# crate rather than a script, so its build output is denied again below.
# ./list-repos does not find it, which means ./check-all never builds it and
# it will rot unless somebody runs it.
!/ray-spike
/ray-spike/target
!/contact-sheet
!/refresh-screenshots
!/refresh-examples
!/build-web
!/stamp
!/check-fresh
!/release
!/play
!/.cargo

# The skills that say how to work on these repos, which tie the project
# together as much as the checks do.
!/.claude
